SUMMARY:Mary Poppins at Paper Mill Playhouse
DESCRIPTION:Disney and Cameron Mackintosh’s Mary Poppins flies into Paper Mill Playhouse for the holiday season. The show runs 2 hours and 30 minutes including intermission\, suggested for ages 4 and up. It plays Wednesday\, November 18\, 2026 through Sunday\, January 3\, 2027; performance times vary\, with typical evening curtains at 7:30 p.m. Full details at Shop Essex County: https://shopyourcounty.com/nj/essex/mary-poppins-paper-mill-playhouse-2026/ \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
