SUMMARY:Tired of Doing All The Heavy Lifting in Your Relationships?
DESCRIPTION:Are you the one who always remembers\, plans\, initiates conversations\, keeps the peace\, and makes sure everyone else is okay?\nWhether it’s your marriage\, partnership\, family\, friendships\, or other relationships\, carrying the emotional weight can leave you feeling exhausted\, overwhelmed\, and disconnected.\nJoin Sakirat Oladiran\, Nurse Practitioner and Certified Life & Health Coach\, for an intimate and supportive wellness gathering designed for women.\nWe’ll explore how relationship stress impacts your physical and emotional health\, why you may find yourself carrying more than your share\, and practical ways to communicate your needs\, establish healthy boundaries\, and create more balanced\, fulfilling connections.\nThis is an opportunity to pause\, reflect\, feel heard\, and walk away with practical strategies to support both your relationships and your well-being.\nCome as you are. Leave with a fresh perspective and tools to create healthier connections. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/tired-of-doing-all-the-heavy-lifting-in-your-relationships/
LOCATION:The Space\, 356 Bloomfield Avenue\, Montclair\, United States
CATEGORIES:Health & Wellness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Wellness-reset-flyer-with-natural-portrait.png
ORGANIZER;CN="356 Bloomfield Avenue%2C #2 Montclair%2C NJ 07042":MAILTO:sakiratwellness@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
