SUMMARY:Estate Sale of Mary Wood
DESCRIPTION:For nearly six decades\, this New Jersey couple had a front-row seat to the world of fine things. She ran estate sales across the state for more than 40 years\, and in his retirement years he ran an art gallery. Their trained eyes and lifelong love of beautiful\, well-made objects are reflected throughout their home: museum-quality paintings\, Oriental and Native American rugs\, period furniture\, fine jewelry and crystal\, alongside the playful finds of true collectors\, including antique trains\, vintage toys\, a pool table\, and a workshop full of old tools. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
