SUMMARY:Three Stories. One Screen. | The Official Film Showcase
DESCRIPTION:Dive into three stories on one screen at The Official Film Showcase—live and in person at The Clairidge in Montclair\, NJ!\nHeadlining the afternoon is End of the Line: Brotherhood\, a raw\, poignant feature drama examining end-of-life dignity\, caregiver burnout\, and the historical roots of healthcare distrust in the Black community through the lens of an underfunded inner-city hospice clinic. Shot using 6K digital cinema technology\, the film features an ensemble cast including veteran actors Christopher Mann (The Wire\, Creed III) and Nakia Dillard (The Wire\, Black Lightning).\nThe program also showcases the exclusive premiere of short drama Wedding Night and psychological thriller Lady in the Mirror. Guests will enjoy light food\, networking opportunities\, and an interactive post-screening filmmaker talkback with cast and crew from all films discussing the story\, production journey\, and social impact behind the work. \nDate: Saturday\, November 21\, 2026\nTime: 1:30 PM – 5:00 PM EST\nVenue: The Clairidge\nAddress: 486 Bloomfield Ave\, Montclair\, NJ 07042\nAdmission / Ticket Price: $24.72\nWebsite/ Tickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/three-stories-one-screen-the-official-film-showcase-tickets-2002222383046\nParking: Metered street parking available \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/three-stories-one-screen-the-official-film-showcase/
LOCATION:The Clairidge\, 486 Bloomfield Ave\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art & Culture,Community,Entertainment,Film
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Three-Stories.-One-Screen.png
END:VEVENT
