SUMMARY:Three Stories. One Screen. | The Official Film Showcase
DESCRIPTION:Experience an afternoon of compelling independent cinema at The Official Film Showcase at The Clairidge in Montclair! The afternoon features three distinct works\, headlined by the feature drama “End of the Line: Brotherhood”—a powerful\, grounded look at hospice care\, caregiver burnout\, and systemic healthcare trust created by Randle B. Haley and directed by Lamont Fountain (“72 Seconds in Rittenhouse Square”). The event also includes short drama premieres (“Wedding Night” and “Lady in the Mirror”)\, light food\, networking\, and an interactive post-screening filmmaker talkback. \nDate: Saturday\, November 21\, 2026\nTime: 1:30 PM – 5:00 PM EST\nLocation: The Clairidge |  486 Bloomfield Ave\, Montclair\, NJ 07042\nAdmission Price: $24.72 \nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/three-stories-one-screen-the-official-film-showcase-tickets-2002222383046\nParking: Metered street parking available\nOfficial Website & Trailer: legsfilmgroup.com \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
