SUMMARY:FREE: TWO'S THE CHARM - New Play Reading
DESCRIPTION:Two short plays\, Jonathan Samarro’s Alas and Alack in Alaska and Joseph Vitale’s A Cigarette with Santa\, are the next featured works in The Theater Project’s 2026 New Play Readings series\, scheduled for 2 p.m. on Saturday\, November 21\, at Cranford Community Center’s 110-seat theater. Admission is free\, with no registration required. \nIn Alas and Alack in Alaska\, 12-year-old Squirm runs away from her persecutors in school and sets out to find the mother she doesn’t really remember. Maybe Mommy lives in Alaska. Or maybe she lives in Squirm’s head.\nIn A Cigarette with Santa\, a burned-out department-store St. Nick meets a cheery elf\, who won’t let him throw in the towel. What could possibly happen? Perhaps a Christmas miracle. \nBoth readings are directed by Thomas Copeland. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/free-twos-the-charm-new-play-reading/
