DESCRIPTION:Meet the Artists is back for the holidays! After the wonderful response to our first event in May\, we’re excited to welcome everyone back to Astra Jewelers for another afternoon celebrating local art\, creativity\, and the talented artists in our community. \nOur returning artists will be showcasing some of their newest work\, and we’ll be introducing new featured artists as well. Additional names will be announced soon! \nAstra Jewelers will also have a collection of fine jewelry available for holiday shopping. \nAn afternoon dedicated to local art\, the people behind it\, and the creative community that makes Montclair so special. We look forward to welcoming you. \nSaturday\, November 21 | 2 PM to 5 PM \nAstra Jewelers\n250 Bellevue Avenue\, 2nd Floor\nUpper Montclair\, NJ 07043 \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
