DESCRIPTION:Join us for Deck the Halls\, The Montclair Foundation’s annual holiday fundraiser and a beloved tradition that brings our community together in celebration of the season. This year we are honoring the amazing Human Needs Food Pantry of Montclair\, and Betty Jagoda Murphy\, a dedicated and active supporter of nonprofit and community organizations for decades and a Montclair Foundation Trustee.\nThe joyful celebration will be held at Montclair Art Museum and will include cocktails\, a strolling dinner\, a live auction with unique prizes and live music. Tribute ads in our printed event program and tickets to the event can be purchased on our website. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
