SUMMARY:Candlelight Breathwork with Julie & Billy
DESCRIPTION:An immersive evening of breath\, connection\, and renewal. \nFor one special evening\, Loopwell transforms into an intimate\, candlelit sanctuary for a guided breathwork experience with Julie and Billy of Spirit 11ouse. \nSurrounded by soft candlelight\, lush greenery\, and a calming atmosphere\, you’ll be invited to slow down\, turn inward\, and reconnect with yourself through the power of breath. \nBreathwork is an accessible practice that can support self-awareness\, relaxation\, and a deeper connection between mind and body. Julie and Billy will introduce the therapeutic benefits of breathwork for self-care and well-being\, then guide you step by step through a three-part active breathing technique in a safe\, supportive environment. \nWhether you’re new to breathwork or looking to deepen your practice\, this experience offers dedicated time to pause\, explore\, and recharge. \nYour experience includes: \nAn introduction to the benefits of breathwork for self-care and well-being \nStep-by-step guidance through a three-part active breathing technique \nA candlelit setting surrounded by greenery and calming sensory elements \nA safe\, supportive space to reconnect with yourself and your breath \nMake yourself comfortable: We recommend bringing a blanket\, eye mask\, and water. A yoga mat is also welcome to help you settle in. \nJulie and Billy from Spirit 11ouse leading a breathwork session at Loopwell in Montclair\nAbout Julie and Billy\nBreathwork instructors Billy and Julie co-created Spirit 11ouse\, to forever stay connected to a path of healing\, expansion\, and connection. Billy and Julie like to see themselves as a bridge between you and ancient practices that will ultimately bring you home to yourself\, others\, and Spirit. Billy had a private practice as a licensed psychotherapist for 15 years and has directed nearly 60 mindfulness retreats with local high school students. In addition\, Billy is also a certified yoga instructor. Julie brings nearly 25 years of entrepreneurship to their venture and is passionate about impacting the lives of others. She is the founder of Chavez for Charity which proudly donated $1.6 million to different charitable organizations worldwide. Both are passionate about making the people they work with feel at home and supported. \nBeyond their dedication to guiding and serving others\, they cherish time with their four kids and all the adventure that family life brings. \nLearn more: spirit11ouse.com\nInstagram: @spirit11ouse \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/candlelight-breathwork-with-julie-billy/
LOCATION:Loopwell\, 80 Maple Ave\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Health & Wellness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Candle-Light-Wellness-Room.jpeg
END:VEVENT
