SUMMARY:Performance: The Hands Free & Dance Heginbotham: "The Party Scene" Holiday Kickoff
DESCRIPTION:Holiday Kickoff!\nMembers of the fabulously whimsical Dance Heginbotham join the eclectic ensemble The Hands Free for The Party Scene\, a music-and-dance extravaganza inspired by The Nutcracker and your rowdy holiday office party. Lightly immersive and family-friendly\, The Party Scene features Nathan Koci (accordion)\, Christina Courtin (violin)\, James Moore (guitar and banjo)\, and Eleonore Oppenheim (bass)\, plus students from Montclair State University. \nFamily-friendly! Cookies and Cocoa will be served! Wear Your Holiday Sweaters! \nDance Heginbotham (DH) is a New York-based contemporary dance company committed to supporting\, producing\, and performing the work of choreographer John Heginbotham. Emphasizing collaboration\, DH enriches national and international communities with its unique blend of inventive\, thoughtful\, and rigorous dance theater works. \n50% of Tickets for children under 12 USE CODE PARTY50 \nTICKETS: tix.com/ticket-sales/PeakPerf/1631/event/1478159 \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
